OL,3,APolice officer dies and another injured
OL,4,Aafter backpack explosion in Oviedo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has died and another
OL,7,Fhas been injured after a backpack
OL,8,Fexplosion in the northern Spanish city
OL,9,Fof Oviedo.
OL,11,FThe explosion occurred when officers
OL,12,Ffrom Spain's Special Canine Unit
OL,13,Farrived to examine a suspicious
OL,14,Fbackpack on Tuesday morning, police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FSpanish police paid tribute to the
OL,18,Fofficer, who has been named as Juan
OL,19,FJose, in a statement on X and said:
OL,20,F"Our hearts are with his family,
OL,21,Ffriends, colleagues and loved ones."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
